way of putting it.

533
00:44:15,089 --> 00:44:16,023
My cat.

534
00:44:18,726 --> 00:44:22,997
What a roundabout way to
ask me how I got them.

535
00:44:24,965 --> 00:44:26,667
How I got to my scars.

536
00:44:28,469 --> 00:44:30,871
The scars of a Cheshire cat.

537
